    turnFlow: '1. Draw one card from the stock or the top of the discard pile. 2. Optionally meld sets (3–4 of a rank) or runs (3+ consecutive same suit). 3. Optionally lay off cards on existing melds. 4. Discard one card face up to end your turn. 5. First to empty their hand ends the hand; hands are then evaluated or scored using poker hand rankings.',
